All of the connected components of $G_{4}(M)$ and
$G_{7}(M)$ are finite. The minimum $\ell \in \NN$ such that
$G_{\ell}(M)$ has an infinite connected component is $\ell = 10$
(see Figure~\ref{fig:infinite slice}).

