\subjclass[2010]{Primary: 13F99, 52B20 ; Secondary: 33C70, 20M25}

\begin{abstract}
We provide explicit combinatorial descriptions of the primary
components of codimension two lattice basis ideals. 
As an application, we compute the set of parameters for which a
bivariate Horn system of hypergeometric differential equations is
holonomic. 
\end{abstract}
